{"case": {"case_id": "2024-CP-011493", "case_type": "estate_intestate", "county": "Cumberland", "parties": {"decedent": {"full_name": "Arthur J. Pelletier", "address": "142 Birchwood Rd, Portland, ME 04103", "phone": "(207) 555-0142", "attrs": {"status": "deceased"}}, "applicant": {"full_name": "Eleanor M. Pelletier", "relationship_to_subject": "spouse", "address": "142 Birchwood Rd, Portland, ME 04103", "phone": "(207) 555-0198"}, "personal_representative": {"full_name": "Eleanor M. Pelletier", "attrs": {"appointment_date": "2024-05-20", "bond_required": false}}, "claimant": {"full_name": "Marcus T. Vance", "address": "88 Commerce St, Auburn, ME 04210", "phone": "(207) 555-0241", "attrs": {"claim_amount": 18500.0, "claim_basis": "Unpaid invoices for commercial landscaping services"}}}, "facts": {"creditor_claim_filed": true, "claim_disallowed": true, "testacy": "intestate", "spouse_surviving": true, "has_minor_heirs": false, "real_estate_in_estate": true}, "narrative": "Decedent Arthur J. Pelletier died intestate on April 12, 2024, survived by his spouse Eleanor and two adult children. Eleanor petitioned for and received appointment as Personal Representative on May 20, 2024. On June 15, 2024, Marcus T. Vance filed a creditor claim for $18,500 alleging unpaid landscaping invoices. The PR investigated estate records, found no valid contract or authorization, and formally disallowed the claim on July 10, 2024, mailing the statutory notice of disallowance. The claimant subsequently filed a petition to have the claim allowed, triggering a contested creditor proceeding. The estate holds title to a Portland single-family residence and liquid assets totaling approximately $210,000. The court must determine the validity of the claim under Maine Uniform Probate Code provisions before final distribution can proceed.", "party_lists": {}, "extra_parties": {}}, "event": {"case_id": "2024-CP-011493", "type": "decedent_death_date", "date": "2024-04-12", "description": "Decedent Arthur J. Pelletier passed away at Maine Medical Center, triggering intestate probate administration and creditor claim windows."}, "id": "estate_int_claim_dispute_969", "description": "Synthesized estate_intestate case", "scenario": "creditor_claim_disputed"}
{"case": {"case_type": "estate_testate", "case_id": "C-2024-01852", "parties": {"decedent": {"full_name": "Arthur Vance Thibodeau", "address": "14 Maple Ridge Rd, Portland, ME 04103", "phone": "207-555-0142"}, "personal_representative": {"full_name": "Eleanor M. Thibodeau", "address": "14 Maple Ridge Rd, Portland, ME 04103", "phone": "207-555-0198", "relationship_to_subject": "Daughter"}, "applicant": {"full_name": "Eleanor M. Thibodeau", "address": "14 Maple Ridge Rd, Portland, ME 04103", "phone": "207-555-0198"}, "claimant": {"full_name": "Northlight HVAC Solutions LLC", "address": "88 Commerce Park Dr, Auburn, ME 04210", "phone": "207-555-0271"}, "attorney": {"full_name": "David P. Langlais", "address": "200 Congress St, Portland, ME 04101", "phone": "207-555-0305", "attrs": {"bar_number": "ME-4492"}, "email": "d.langlais@mainelaw.com"}}, "facts": {"creditor_claim_filed": true, "claim_disallowed": true, "has_will": true, "spouse_surviving": false, "real_estate_in_estate": true, "has_minor_heirs": false}, "narrative": "Decedent executed a valid will appointing his daughter Eleanor M. Thibodeau as personal representative. Following the decedent's death, Northlight HVAC Solutions LLC filed a creditor claim for $18,500 alleging unpaid work on a heating system. The PR formally disallowed the claim, citing lack of authorization and disputed service completion. The claimant has subsequently petitioned the Cumberland County Probate Court to resolve the dispute and determine the validity of the debt against estate assets.", "opened_date": "2024-10-05", "county": "Maine Probate Court - Cumberland", "party_lists": {}, "extra_parties": {}}, "event": {"case_id": "C-2024-01852", "type": "will_admission_date", "date": "2024-10-18", "description": "Petition to admit Last Will and Testament of Arthur V. Thibodeau filed and admitted to probate. Letters testamentary subsequently issued to Eleanor M. Thibodeau."}, "id": "maine_estate_testate_185", "description": "Synthesized estate_testate case", "scenario": "creditor_claim_disputed"}
{"case": {"case_id": "PR-2024-000892", "case_type": "estate_testate", "parties": {"decedent": {"full_name": "Eleanor M. Thibodeau", "address": "412 Pine Tree Rd, Augusta, ME 04330", "phone": "207-555-0198"}, "applicant": {"full_name": "Meridian Financial Services LLC", "address": "88 Main St, Suite 200, Portland, ME 04101", "phone": "207-555-0142"}, "personal_representative": {"full_name": "Daniel R. Thibodeau", "address": "15 Oak Hill Dr, Windham, ME 04062", "phone": "207-555-0177"}, "attorney": {"full_name": "Sarah J. Levesque", "address": "220 Congress St, Portland, ME 04101", "phone": "207-555-0133", "attrs": {"bar_number": "ME-19734"}, "email": "sarah.levesque@mainelaw.com"}}, "facts": {"creditor_claim_filed": true, "claim_disallowed": true, "testacy": "testate", "real_estate_in_estate": true, "spouse_surviving": false}, "narrative": "Eleanor M. Thibodeau died testate on 2024-03-12, leaving a valid will naming Daniel R. Thibodeau as personal representative. On 2024-06-18, Meridian Financial Services LLC filed a creditor claim for $14,250 in alleged unpaid medical equipment rentals. The PR reviewed the claim and issued a formal disallowance on 2024-08-22, citing lack of proper itemization and expiration of the contractual period under 18-A M.R.S. \u00a7 3-901. Unsatisfied with the disallowance, the creditor filed a petition to resolve the disputed claim, seeking court determination on the validity and amount owed by the estate.", "party_lists": {}, "extra_parties": {}}, "event": {"case_id": "PR-2024-000892", "type": "petition_filing_date", "date": "2024-09-15", "description": "Petition to Resolve Disputed Claim filed by applicant following PR disallowance notice."}, "id": "maine_probate_estate_testate_cred_disputed_186", "description": "Synthesized estate_testate case", "scenario": "creditor_claim_disputed"}
